Eru
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
ITUX 4 FACE_HALF
ITUX 7 FACE_HALF
ITUX 2 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE ITUX ITUX
AND
    DESTSRC Rank ascending
    OR
        DEST Empty
        SRC Suit {SPADES, CLUBS, HEARTS}
MOVE_STACK ITUX ITUX
OR
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        DEST Empty
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DESTSRC Rank equal
$win
PILE ALL ITUX Empty
